<title>USA: Newcor acquires Plastronics Plus.</title>
<headline>Newcor acquires Plastronics Plus.</headline>
<dateline>BLOOMFIELD HILLS, Mich. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newcor Inc said Monday it acquired for cash the common stock of Plastronics Plus Inc, a custom plastic injection molding company with current annual sales of approximately $16 million.</p>
<p>With the acquisition of Plastronics Plus, Newcor said its rubber and plastic group will have combined annual sales approaching $60 million.</p>
<p>Newcor designs and manufactures precision-machined and molded rubber and plastic products as well as custom machines and manufacturing systems.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
